#: model:ir.model,name:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base.model_l10n_sk_payslip_fund_mixin
msgid "Recorded payroll fund evidence"
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#: model:ir.model,name:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base.model_l10n_sk_payslip_joint_tax_mixin
msgid "Slovak payslip: several records of one person taxed together"
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base.field_hr_employee__l10n_sk_tax_principal_id
msgid "Taxed Together With"
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/hr_employee.py:0
msgid ""
"Taxed Together With of %(employee)s cannot be changed now. The payslip "
"%(payslip)s moved its tax base to the payslip of %(principal)s, and of the "
"two payslips of that month one is confirmed and the other is not. Confirm "
"both, or refund the confirmed one, and change the link then."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/payslip_joint_tax_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"Taxed Together With of %(employee)s, or the contract of the record named "
"there, changed after this payslip was computed. Compute the payslip again "
"before confirming it."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base.field_hr_employee__l10n_sk_tax_linked_ids
msgid "Taxed on This Record"
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base.field_hr_employee__l10n_sk_tax_linked_ids
msgid ""
"The employee records of the same person whose tax base is taxed on the "
"payslip of this record."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/payslip_joint_tax_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"The income tax of %(employee)s is computed together with %(linked)s (Taxed "
"Together With). The payslip %(payslip)s of %(linked)s for this month is not "
"computed yet, or was computed before the two records were linked. Compute it"
" first."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/payslip_joint_tax_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"The payslip %(payslip)s of %(principal)s for this month is confirmed, and "
"its income tax includes a tax base of %(took).2f taken over from the records"
" taxed together with it. With this payslip of %(employee)s that base would "
"be %(now).2f. Refund or cancel the payslip of %(principal)s first, then "
"compute this payslip and a new one for %(principal)s."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/payslip_joint_tax_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"The payslip of %(employee)s was computed with a tax base of %(took).2f taken"
" over from %(linked)s, and their payslips of this month now hold %(now).2f. "
"Compute the payslip of %(employee)s again before confirming it."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/payslip_fund_mixin.py:0
msgid "The recorded payroll fund bases are invalid."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/payslip_fund_mixin.py:0
msgid "The recorded payroll fund bases no longer match the payslip."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/payslip_joint_tax_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"The tax base of this payslip of %(employee)s is taxed on the confirmed "
"payslip %(payslip)s of %(principal)s. Refund or cancel that payslip first."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/payslip_joint_tax_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"The wage garnishment of %(employee)s cannot be computed on this payslip. Its"
" income tax is computed together with %(other)s, and a garnishment is "
"deducted from the person's whole net wage from the employer (§ 69 Exekučného"
" poriadku), which one payslip does not hold. Remove Taxed Together With to "
"tax the records separately, or leave the garnishment out of this payslip and"
" deduct it by hand."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#: model:ir.model,name:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base.model_hr_version
msgid "Employee Contract"
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/payslip_fund_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"%(employee)s: no sick pay is computed for the incapacity from %(onsets)s, "
"because its daily assessment base cannot be determined from the confirmed "
"payslips. Enter the base as the payslip input PN_DVZ."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/hr_employee.py:0
msgid ""
"%(linked)s is taxed together with %(employee)s, so the two records have to "
"stay in one company."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/hr_employee.py:0
msgid ""
"%(principal)s is itself taxed together with %(other)s. Choose %(other)s for "
"%(employee)s as well: one record taxes the month for all the others."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base.field_hr_employee__l10n_sk_tax_principal_id
msgid ""
"Another employee record of the same person in this company, for example the "
"employment beside this agreement. The income tax of this record is then "
"computed on the payslip of that record: it taxes the total of the month with"
" one non-taxable amount and one child tax bonus (§ 35 ods. 1 zákona č. "
"595/2003 Z. z.), and the payslip of this record shows its tax base and no "
"tax. Compute the payslip of this record first. Leave empty to tax this "
"record on its own."
msgstr ""
